From 6c938358516eddf9fd372c0f403d04ac91ad33fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 08:01:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] Preserve the platform manager experiment before
 simplification

Constraint: The current cross-project state must remain recoverable while development returns to the earlier dex-unpack implementation.

Rejected: Leaving changes only in detached worktrees | switching revisions would obscure or discard the WIP.

Confidence: high

Scope-risk: narrow

Directive: Treat r0dump-too-complex-wip as an archival checkpoint; reassess scope before reusing this platform architecture.

Tested: Manager source tree, test module, and validation tools were staged and inspected.

Not-tested: Complete end-to-end deployment and real-device acceptance of this exact cross-project checkpoint.
